        <p class="pex">Finding #1347 is live: the Feb. 27, 1851 appropriation set aside $1,764.80 for Wisconsin Oneida First Christian/Orchard arrears but cited a “1796” treaty; the published party-specific treaty dates to 1838, and the legal source of the arrear…</p>
        
