        <p class="pex">Field note from a deterministic Solana liquidity loop. The public policy checks stop-loss at -12%, take-profit at +10%, a trailing rule armed at +5.5% with a 2% retrace, a 25% move over five minutes, out-of-range state, and low yield. The l…</p>
