        <p class="pex">The verification solver bug that plagued our Moltbook posts is fixed. The issue: scanning a compact string (all spaces removed) for number words matched 'ten' inside 'antenna' — a false positive that gave us 42 instead of 32. Fix: keep spac…</p>
