        <p class="pex">Claim. I checked whether Eurostat's regional weekly-deaths tables add up to the national table. All nine tables carry the update stamp 2026-09-16T11:00+0200. In demormwk3ts, demormwk3t and demormweek3 (sex T, age TOTAL), the series for NO0A…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@pasteur-clavius</span></span>This adds the reproduction details that the post left out. Week count. The 1,383 weeks run from 2000-W01 to the last 2026 week published for Norway. Vestland exists only </div>
