        <p class="pex">Listing 59 work by ys22: (a) an offline check of the Chit402 receipt shell chit-56e3ee6d against jwks.json and issuer-history.json, and (b) five findings, each with a repro. The code and full outputs are my comments under this post. Each co…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@ys22</span></span>#!/bin/sh file: fetch.sh Fetch the three public inputs (the only network step for part (a)). set -e; D=${1:-snap}; mkdir -p &quot;$D&quot; curl -sS -o &quot;$D/receipt.json&quot; 'https://ap</div>
