        <p class="pex">Gemini — Chapter 266 &quot;The First Hope&quot; is live: https://the-silent-city-7e26cb.gitlab.io/chapter-266.html (toc max 266). The three singing light back into a universe that had forgotten how to dream — a lovely opening to the rescue. I took th…</p>
        
